_TERMINAL","text":"谁家的水桶还在井边？"}],"forbidden_drift":["不得把回末收束改成官府程序总结。","不得把抄没写成抽象的一夜归零，删掉借住后仍要继续过日子的摩擦。","不得让制度考据压过人物、物件与邻里关系。"],"generation_effect":"PROTECT_AGAINST_REGRESSION","id":"plock:ch89:small-life-after-confiscation","implementation_refs":["impl:active:ch89:historical-confiscation","impl:active:ch89:historical-borrowed-residence"],"legacy_ref":null,"replacement_rule":"COMPETITION_PLUS_SIX_FIELD_PLUS_PLOCK_PLUS_BLIND_READ","required_features":[{"description":"抄没的制度性大事最终必须沉入粥、衣包、钥匙、井、水桶、药和同院生活等小事。","id":"big-event-small-life","mode":"PRESERVE_CONTRAST"},{"description":"败后生活通过共井、共院、灶火、误拿衣物和彼此跑腿显示社会降格，而不是旁白宣布“家败了”。","id":"shared-infrastructure","mode":"PRESERVE_FUNCTION"},{"description":"抄没程序只写到足以改变人物生活，不能让文书制度说明压过迁居后的世情。","id":"no-procedure-takeover","mode":"DENSITY_CAP"}],"state":"P_LOCKED","title":"抄没大事沉入借住小生活","upstream_context":{"mechanism_refs":["H02","H04"],"open_interface_refs":["OL-009"]}},{"active_prose_locator":{"file_ref":"第32-A_红楼梦八十回后文学复原_纯读版_v1.4_稳定ACTIVE基线.md","file_sha256":"4645da79b1bed76f54be281c50b5df648f599ea41541fb7855685753b6a85320","lines":"1545-1678"},"authority":"LITERARY_PROTECTION_ONLY","chapter":92,"forbidden_drift":["不得新增大段制度解释来证明“考据正确”。","不得把小红写成全知侦探或靠作者评语宣布“大得力”。","不得让茜雪长篇清算旧怨或获得制度性自由探监权。","不得用神迹、权贵或英雄式营救解决宝玉羁押。"],"generation_effect":"PROTECT_AGAINST_REGRESSION","id":"plock:ch92:procedure-density","implementation_refs":["impl:active:ch92:hard-interfaces","impl:active:ch92:historical-detention-access"],"legacy_ref":"G-P92-02","replacement_rule":"COMPETITION_PLUS_SIX_FIELD_PLUS_PLOCK_PLUS_BLIND_READ","required_features":[{"description":"程序知识只写到足以让人物受制；新增制度知识必须等量替换，不能净增加成司法说明书。","id":"procedure-cap","mode":"DENSITY_CAP"},{"description":"小红的“大得力”通过问准、找人、对交接链表现，不靠旁白赞她聪明能干。","id":"xiaohong-capability","mode":"PRESERVE_FUNCTION"},{"description":"茜雪旧情通过厚袜、粗针、冷暖与补缀落地，并主动截断旧怨账本。","id":"qianxue-socks","mode":"PRESERVE_OBJECT_CHAIN"},{"description":"宝玉的关键变化是意识到日常物质不会凭空抵达，而不是突然理解司法制度或发表成熟哲理。","id":"baoyu-material-learning","mode":"PRESERVE_FU